  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kgl Musikh&#xf6;gskolan i Stockholm forts&#xe4;tter sitt samarbete med musikakademier och -skolor i Bosnien och Serbien/Montenegro. St&#xf6;det best&#xe5;r av elev- och l&#xe4;rarutbyten, utbildningar i Stockholm och inom Balkan, ink&#xf6;p av instrument mm, konsertresor mm.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Royal University College of Music continues its cooperation with music high schools and academies in Bosnia and Serbia&amp;Montenegro. The support consists of the exchange of students and teachers, training in Stockholm and in Sarajevo, purchase of used instruments for schools, concert tours etc.</narrative>
